{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairground Online \u2013 Your Ultimate Ride Simulator!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrilling world of amusement rides like never before! In <i>Fairground Online</i>, you control realistic attractions, create unforgettable experiences, and immerse yourself in a vibrant fairground world \u2013 all in online multiplayer with other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Enjoy the fair with friends or players from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Ride Physics and Controls:</strong> Operate each ride with authentic control panels \u2013 from speed and rotation to special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting Control:</strong> Customize the lighting of your rides and create stunning light shows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music and Jingle Control:</strong> Choose music and announcements to create the perfect atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle:</strong> Experience the fair during the day and night \u2013 each time of day offers a unique ambiance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the most exciting rides \u2013 alone or with friends. The fairground is waiting for you!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get on a ride","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310530/5afffed3a06f98d9b21cc78e47e8f8dd5d43536b.jpg"},{"name":"Operate a ride","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310530/3a0da30d16a906e0cc42fe18721315a65713710c.jpg"},{"name":"Sell a ticket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310530/df5c95ae918d243f5744d1d1ee814987737adac0.jpg"},{"name":"Sell 10 tickets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni